cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "rateguard: Thread-safe local rate limiting for LLM API clients in Python"
version: 0.2.0
date-released: "2026-05-07"
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/vdeshmukh203/rateguard"
repository-code: "https://github.com/vdeshmukh203/rateguard"
abstract: >
  rateguard provides thread-safe token-bucket and sliding-window rate limiters
  for Python applications that call large language model APIs. It uses only the
  standard library and exposes a wait-time API compatible with both synchronous
  and asyncio code bases.
keywords:
  - rate limiting
  - token bucket
  - sliding window
  - large language models
  - LLM
  - API
  - Python
  - concurrency
authors:
  - family-names: Deshmukh
    given-names: Vaibhav
